+"""Verified problem generator for arXiv:2408.15759.
+
+The native object is the weighted top intersection of Scorza divisor classes
+on a product C^n of a genus-three curve.  Section 4, Lemma 4.5 proves the
+unweighted identity.  Multilinearity carries it through the rational weights;
+the weights are generated as a shuffled telescoping chain, so their product is
+known without solving the displayed instance.
