+        "balance between numerators and denominators, leaving only two endpoints; "
+        "without this invariant one must accumulate every large rational weight."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Section 4, Lemma 4.5 gives the unweighted Scorza-class identity; "
+        "the disclosed exact Fraction accumulation is O(n) and at shipping n=256 "
+        "uses 1,284 counted arithmetic primitives and averaged 0.00027 seconds "
