codex
The shipping-size selftest is still in its measured reference pass; this is expected because G6 deliberately runs the full 276.8-million-operation algorithm on eight independent instances. The fast verifier and compact solver do not enumerate those factors.
diff --git a/gen_2408_15759.py b/gen_2408_15759.py
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..92f1c286c7b0b119b5c1a407402ee15a4801064d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/gen_2408_15759.py
@@ -0,0 +1,878 @@
+"""Verified problem generator for arXiv:2408.15759.
+
+The native object is the weighted top intersection of Scorza divisor classes
+on a product C^n of a genus-three curve.  Section 4, Lemma 4.5 proves the
+unweighted identity.  Multilinearity carries it through the rational weights;
+the weights are generated as a shuffled telescoping chain, so their product is
+known without solving the displayed instance.
