+    "description": (
+        "A JSON object with exactly two distinct ordered exponential terms.  Each "
+        "term is {coefficient:[num,den],base:b,exponent:n}; den is positive, the "
+        "instance gives inclusive numerator/denominator bounds, and the exponent "
+        "is exactly the displayed n.  Term 0 has positive numerator and base 2..9; "
+        "term 1 has negative numerator and base 1.  Terms are added and rational "
