codex
Implemented and verified a Track B native-algebra generator based on Section 4 of [*Plane quartics and heptagons*](https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.15759).

Key results:

- All G1–G9 gates pass.
- Structure-aware guessing: 0/200,000.
- Four adversarial attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Reference algorithm: 276,824,073 operations at shipping size.
- Compact invariant route: 8 operations.
- Bare hardening result: 0/3 solved.
- Answer size: 178 characters, 8 atoms.
- Independent full self-test rerun passed.

Deliverables:

- [Generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2408.15759/gen_2408_15759.py)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2408.15759/selftest_report.json)
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2408.15759/README.md)
- [Bare oracle transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2408.15759/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [Structural-hint transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2408.15759/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Placebo-hint transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2408.15759/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

The README explicitly notes that two decisive bare failures were empty Gemini responses; the remaining oracle produced a substantive but incorrect coefficient.
